                "entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                "word": "disneylandisation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c9ffc37e-0f4e-4a9c-b3a0-80a30191d210",
                        "entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "disneylandisations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                        "entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Transformation d’un endroit, d’une région, d’une société, pour répondre aux attentes et aux présupposés des touristes, des spectateurs, comme dans un parc d’attractions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e998273d-6ee5-4923-97f5-859eeb1346c0",
                                "sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                                "text": "Animaux sauvages, populations misérables (mais tellement heureuses) en costumes « traditionnels », qui dansent spontanément à l’arrivée des touristes – et sont prêts à leur vendre tous les vêtements, bijoux et outils qu’ils portent sur eux à l’issue du spectacle tant le tourisme représente pour eux une manne providentielle -, la disneylandisation de l’Afrique est aujourd’hui d’autant plus en marche que la majorité des pays africains entendent faire de la recette touristique une de leurs premières sources de devises."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49e07055-02ec-4253-979e-2c2b75c09643",
                                "sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                                "text": "Une pétition en ligne veut empêcher la \"disneylandisation\" du Rigi - Lancée il y a quelques jours, la pétition en ligne \"Non à Disneyworld au Rigi!\" a déjà récolté plus de 750 signatures. Elle s'oppose à un projet d'aménagement de la montagne fétiche des Lucernois."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c67c10c-6df7-48a7-8819-5fe738f87093",
                                "sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                                "text": "Le groupe de riverains à son origine se dit opposé à la « disneylandisation » et à la gestion du site par la Mairie de Paris."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9349c06d-1a3c-46b1-956b-e321be8e0c31",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                        "source_sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                        "target_lang_word": "Disneyfizierung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "349466ef-86c5-4c66-a5eb-679509bbafb6",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                        "source_sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                        "target_lang_word": "Disneyfication",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Disneyfication",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                        "entry_id": "ee66d360-1002-36ba-a146-3905e537a0ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act or process whereby something is Disneyfied."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0939ef89-d933-416e-b5fe-fd81d9301c18",
                                                "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                                "text": "He may even be having his first doubts about the neon chrome artyfake Disneyfication of America."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71d1510b-3c8d-4a11-97d1-88e823765621",
                                                "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                                "text": "Cultural diversity mirrors the biological and geographical diversity of our planet. ’Disneyfication’, like economic globalization, tends to ride roughshod over local variety. So baseball hats, blue jeans and running shoes become the uniform of teenagers in both Budapest and Bangalore while Western TV shows promote the illusion of limitless wealth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48d2a8d7-3662-4ae0-b032-7da70ebba95c",
                                                "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                                "text": "The Disneyfication of Tibet\nHow tourism has become a tool of occupation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a0edb6-43c0-45f7-bd94-b0b17e7dd423",
                                                "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                                "text": "Given that Onward itself is a family-friendly project, the film thrives on these self-aware digs at Disneyfication; any good D&D mission should have a sense of real danger, so it’s worth pointing out how that’s missing from so much mainstream entertainment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4f4ac09-8259-40e8-b4ed-a57b05dcbc16",
                                                "sense_id": "d58093b8-71a6-3946-87ed-6f46c28f55e4",
                                                "text": "The importation of New World featherworks into Europe was a journey of dilution, degradation and eventual loss of meaning - a banal Disneyfication of indigenous dignity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1bd0f595-5187-4955-b8c5-74c18c73c03d",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d02080f-09fd-3a2f-a4bd-854250f4143f",
                        "source_sense_id": "71ae975f-969b-3ed5-92d8-e841bede9de0",
                        "target_lang_word": "Disneyization",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Disneyization",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
